# The developers' special options dialog, which the slash key opens in a
# mission: as it comes up, and with the speed build box ticked.
# args: -PLAYTEST
at 301 click 320 231
at 341 key RETURN
at 401 click 260 228
at 500 key SLASH
at 520 shot dialog
at 521 click 121 101
at 540 shot speed_build_ticked
at 541 click 441 337
at 560 shot closed
at 561 quit
